  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo Urbano y Mejora del Hbitat del Neuqun</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Development and Habitat Improvement Program of Neuquen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de esta primera operacin individual es contribuir al desarrollo urbano sostenible e inclusivo en la provincia del Neuqun. Sus objetivos especficos son: (i) mejorar de forma integral las reas consolidadas de entornos urbanos; (ii) promover la formalizacin y el desarrollo urbano de barrios populares y reas precarias; y (iii) fortalecer la gestin urbana y territorial sostenible.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this first individual operation is to contribute to sustainable and inclusive urban development in the province of Neuqun. Its specific objectives are: (i) to comprehensively improve established urban areas; (ii) to promote the formalization and urban development of popular neighborhoods and slums; and (iii) to strengthen sustainable urban and territorial management.</narrative>
  </description>
